OL,3,AMedia industry could be forced to
OL,4,Aimprove safeguards after Walliams
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government is prepared to force the
OL,8,Fentertainment industry to improve
OL,9,Fsafeguarding practices unless rapid
OL,10,Fchange is introduced, BBC Newsnight has
OL,11,Flearned.
OL,13,FCulture Secretary Lisa Nandy told the
OL,14,FHouse of Commons she will meet
OL,15,Frepresentatives from the media,
OL,16,Fentertainment and sport next week to
OL,17,F"discuss the action that we need to
OL,18,Ftake" following recent allegations.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
