OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMedia industry could be forced to
OL,4,Aimprove safeguards after Walliams
OL,5,Aallegations
OL,6,
OL,7,F"But if those protections are
OL,8,Finsufficient, the government will not
OL,9,Fhesitate to take further action," she
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FShe could force participation in
OL,13,Fcreative industries industry standards
OL,14,Fbody CIISA, which is currently
OL,15,Fvoluntary, to protect whistleblowers,
OL,16,Fthe BBC understands.
